{"title":"Career Roadmap · Quality Control Analyst","role":"Quality Control Analyst","summary":"A Quality Control (QC) Analyst tests raw materials, in-process samples and finished products to determine whether they meet defined quality specifications.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Microbiology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Quality Control (QC) Analyst tests raw materials, in-process samples and finished products to determine whether they meet defined quality specifications."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Microbiology graduate, the role is particularly relevant in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmaceutical manufacturing"},{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Food and beverage"},{"text":"Diagnostics"},{"text":"Cosmetics"},{"text":"Water and environmental testing"},{"text":"Medical products"},{"text":"Contract testing laboratories"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A microbiology-focused QC analyst commonly works with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microbial enumeration"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Sterility testing"},{"text":"Microbial identification"},{"text":"Culture-based testing"},{"text":"Water testing"},{"text":"Contamination monitoring"},{"text":"Sample management"},{"text":"Laboratory documentation"},{"text":"Data review"},{"text":"Quality systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Microbiology","Microbiological Testing","GMP/GLP","Laboratory Instruments","Environmental Monitoring","Data Integrity","QC Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Microbiology","Microbiology + Biochemistry + Analytical Fundamentals","Laboratory Safety + Aseptic Technique","Culture Methods + Microbial Enumeration","Environmental Monitoring + Water Testing","Microbial Identification + Steri